{"id":219876005880400,"type":"genre","name":"Ballroom","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":35,"info":{"img":null},"own_scenes":[],"similar_scenes":[{"id":251655225374954,"name":"Savoy, Cotton Club y las bandas de Harlem","book":"Historia del jazz","author":"Ted Gioia","start":1921,"end":1942,"desc":"El público blanco descubre Harlem: tras Shuffle Along (1921) llega el slumming, los clubes para blancos con mafia y alcohol de contrabando (Cotton Club, Connie's Inn, Small's Paradise), condescendientes pero capaces de canalizar dinero blanco hacia el arte negro; en la música caen antes que en ningún otro sitio las barreras raciales. El Savoy Ballroom (1926), integrado desde el principio, inventa el Lindy hop que los blancos convierten en jitterbug: la pista dicta la música. Cab Calloway sustituye a Ellington en el Cotton Club con el scat de «Minnie the Moocher»; la banda de Jimmie Lunceford, con los arreglos de Sy Oliver y el contralto de Willie Smith, anticipa el swing; Chick Webb, con temas de Edgar Sampson, gana a Goodman en un duelo del Savoy y lanza a Ella Fitzgerald con «A-Tisket, A-Tasket».","color":"#fb923c","family":"Swing, Harlem y big bands","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/jazz/#harlem-bailes"}],"aka":[],"rym":[{"id":227759640194185,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Ballroom","total":35,"url":"https://rateyourmusic.com/charts/top/album/all-time/g:ballroom/","items":[{"id":77288240374747,"type":"album","name":"Gambiarra chic, pt. 1","artist":"Irmãs de Pau","year":2024,"rank":1,"yt":"eOjZTyDeUL4"},{"id":195449417767063,"type":"album","name":"Pajubá","artist":"Linn da Quebrada","year":2017,"rank":2,"yt":"ZyQwAcodhfo"},{"id":7253798603447,"type":"album","name":"Box of Chocolates","artist":"Kevin Aviance","year":1999,"rank":3,"yt":"MuIxAELIfQU"},{"id":189753492996765,"type":"album","name":"Black Liquid Electronics","artist":"Ase Manual","year":2020,"rank":4,"yt":"CmYOet68nec"},{"id":186111246433122,"type":"album","name":"The Anti Drug","artist":"Divoli S'vere","year":2